Original commit body from 215cb3d:

Similar to the previous fix for --frameworks all, explicit framework
lists like --frameworks fastapi,celery now use the specified frameworks
directly without requiring them to be present in dependency manifests.
This enables pattern matching when pyproject.toml/package.json is in a
subdirectory rather than the repo root.

Also cleans up dead code in _detect_frameworks() - the allowed_frameworks
parameter is no longer needed since only AUTO mode calls this function.
